//@version=6
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  ICT + SMC INSTITUTIONAL TOOLKIT v3 — SEQUENCED ENTRY ENGINE                        v3.0.1
//
//  v2 → v3 (full audit fix pass):
//  * TP/SL same-bar tie now assumes STOP filled first (v2 assumed TP — optimistic bias).
//  * Nearest touched zone feeds the trigger (v2 let the OLDEST touched zone win the bounds).
//  * Score normalized 0-100 over weights IN PLAY; HTF weight leaves the pool when the HTF
//    gate is mandatory (gate + score double-count inflated every signal by 25 pts).
//  * Premium/Discount gate fails CLOSED when the dealing range is invalid (v2 bypassed it).
//  * A sweep during the SHIFTED stage no longer rewinds the machine — it only deepens the
//    stop anchor (sequential sweeps in reversals were killing valid setups).
//  * Displacement measured on candle BODY (optional) — wick-heavy bars no longer count.
//  * Breaker blocks are TRADEABLE: broken OB flips to opposite-direction zone, its retest
//    feeds the setup engine; reclaimed breakers are dropped.
//  * News blackout extended: 08:30 / 09:30 / 10:00 / 14:00 NY.
//  * Dashboard MTF rows flag timeframes below the chart TF instead of showing junk bias.
//
//  v3.0.1 (logic audit):
//  * IFVG taps route by the zone's CURRENT direction — inverted gaps fed the WRONG side's
//    trigger (bearish IFVG living in the bullish array fired BUY signals).
//  * Nearest-tapped-zone rule now spans ALL categories (OB vs FVG vs breaker), not per-array.
//  * A gate failure (score / news / chop / kill-zone / cooldown) no longer consumes the
//    sequence — the trigger is spent only when a signal actually PRINTS.
//  * PD gate + EQ score judge the tapped ZONE midpoint, not the trigger close (a strong
//    rejection bar often closes back across EQ from a perfectly valid zone).
//  * EQ / Kill-Zone weights leave the score pool when their gates are mandatory (same
//    double-count class as the v3 HTF fix); empty pool now passes instead of blocking all.
//  * Sweep + shift may share one bar (single-candle V-reversal); deepest swept level wins px.
//  * CISD reference open is spent after firing; replaced trades print an exit record.
//
//  WHY v2 EXISTS — the v1 entry model was a "bag of flags": any confluence inside a rolling
//  window in ANY order fired a signal. Real ICT setups are a SEQUENCE. v2 replaces the model:
//
//    ① SWEEP    liquidity taken (pivot pools, EQH/EQL, SESSION H/L, PDH/PDL — all feed it)
//    ② SHIFT    displacement break of structure in the opposite direction (MSS / iCHoCH / CISD)
//    ③ RETRACE  price returns into an OB or FVG on the correct side of equilibrium
//    ④ TRIGGER  rejection close inside/beyond the zone → signal
//
//  Each stage has its own timeout. Wrong order = no setup. Opposing external break = reset.
//
//  Other v1→v2 trade-logic changes:
//  * STOP = the sweep extreme (the wick that took liquidity) ± ATR buffer — not "recent swing".
//  * Gates and score are SEPARATED: the sequence is mandatory; the score only measures quality
//    extras (HTF align, OTE tap, kill zone, displacement, zone freshness, EQ side) — no more
//    double-counting the same event in a gate AND the score.
//  * HTF hierarchy: bias comes from the HTF structure machine on a properly-distant HTF
//    (3m chart → 1H, 15m → 4H). No 5-way vote democracy.
//  * Direction-aware cooldown: a BUY does not block a valid SELL reversal.
//  * News blackout: no entries ± N minutes around 08:30 / 09:30 NY (toggleable).
//  * Trade management: entry/stop/target tracked live, optional break-even move at +1R,
//    TP / SL / structure-exit labelled on chart, each with its own alert.
//
//  Rendering, zone lifecycle (born-bar touch guard, later-bar breaker, right-edge freezing,
//  age expiry, duplicate suppression) and the non-repainting contract carry over from v1.
//
//  NON-REPAINTING CONTRACT
//  * Structure = candle CLOSE beyond a CONFIRMED pivot (ta.pivothigh/low never revise).
//  * Every HTF read is expr[1] + lookahead_on — last CLOSED HTF value, zero future leak.
//  * Signals and state transitions commit on barstate.isconfirmed only.
//
//  PINE v6 DISCIPLINE (compile traps this codebase already hit — keep obeying)
//  * Branches of one if/else-if chain must end in the SAME type → split ifs guarded by bools.
//  * Functions cannot assign globals → state lives in UDT fields, results return via tuples.
//  * No object creation inside ?: (both branches evaluate) → always `if na(x)`.
//  * One namespace: never reuse an input name for a runtime flag.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

indicator("ICT + SMC Toolkit v3 — Sequenced", "ICT│SMC v3", overlay = true, max_boxes_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_bars_back = 1500)

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 1. CONSTANTS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

G_GEN = "⚙  General"
G_MS  = "①  Market Structure"
G_LQ  = "②  Liquidity"
G_OB  = "③  Order Blocks"
G_FV  = "④  Fair Value Gaps"
G_PD  = "⑤  Premium / Discount"
G_HL  = "⑥  Previous Highs & Lows"
G_SS  = "⑦  Sessions & Kill Zones"
G_TM  = "⑧  Time Model & News"
G_HT  = "⑨  Higher Timeframe"
G_EN  = "⑩  Setup Engine (sequence)"
G_QS  = "⑪  Quality Score"
G_TR  = "⑫  Trade Management"
G_DB  = "⑬  Dashboard"
G_AL  = "⑭  Alerts"
G_CL  = "⑮  Colors"
G_PF  = "⑯  Performance"
G_RF  = "⑰  Chop Guard (sideways filter)"

DEF_BULL   = #089981
DEF_BEAR   = #f23645
DEF_NEUT   = #787b86
DEF_ACCENT = #ffb300
DEF_INK    = #d1d4dc
DEF_PANEL  = #14161a
DEF_GRID   = #2a2e39
DEF_VIOLET = #7e57c2

ST_FRESH     = 0
ST_MITIGATED = 1
ST_INVALID   = 2
ST_BREAKER   = 3
ST_RECLAIMED = 4

// Setup engine states
SU_IDLE    = 0
SU_SWEPT   = 1
SU_SHIFTED = 2

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// 2. INPUTS
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

tzInput     = input.string("America/New_York", "Reference Timezone", options = ["America/New_York", "Europe/London", "Asia/Tokyo", "Australia/Sydney", "UTC", "Exchange"], group = G_GEN)
tz          = tzInput == "Exchange" ? syminfo.timezone : tzInput
atrLen      = input.int(14, "ATR Length", minval = 2, group = G_GEN)
labelSize   = input.string("normal", "Label Size", options = ["tiny", "small", "normal", "large"], group = G_GEN)
lblSz       = labelSize == "tiny" ? size.tiny : labelSize == "small" ? size.small : labelSize == "large" ? size.large : size.normal
lblSzSm     = labelSize == "tiny" ? size.tiny : labelSize == "small" ? size.tiny : labelSize == "large" ? size.normal : size.small
autoHide    = input.bool(true, "Auto-hide insignificant drawings", group = G_GEN)
noiseFactor = input.float(0.15, "Noise Floor (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, maxval = 1.0, step = 0.01, group = G_GEN)

// ── Market structure ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
msIntLen    = input.int(3, "Internal Swing Length", minval = 1, group = G_MS)
msExtLen    = input.int(8, "External Swing Length", minval = 2, group = G_MS)
msShowInt   = input.bool(true,  "Internal Labels", inline = "msie", group = G_MS)
msShowExt   = input.bool(true,  "External Labels", inline = "msie", group = G_MS)
msDispMult  = input.float(1.5, "Displacement (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = G_MS)
msDispBody  = input.bool(true, "Displacement uses candle body", group = G_MS, tooltip = "Body = |close − open|. Full range lets a wick-heavy indecision bar count as displacement — institutional displacement is a conviction CLOSE, not a wick.")
msMaxDraw   = input.int(8, "Max Structure Drawings", minval = 1, maxval = 60, group = G_MS)
msShowCISD  = input.bool(true, "CISD Labels", group = G_MS)

// ── Liquidity ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
lqEqTol     = input.float(0.12, "Equal H/L Tolerance (× ATR)", minval = 0.01, step = 0.01, group = G_LQ)
lqShowPools = input.bool(true, "Draw Liquidity Levels", group = G_LQ)
lqSessFeed  = input.bool(true, "Session H/L are liquidity", group = G_LQ, tooltip = "Asia / London-open / NY-open range extremes register as sweepable levels — the classic 'NY sweeps Asia high' setup arms the engine.")
lqPdFeed    = input.bool(true, "PDH / PDL are liquidity", group = G_LQ)
lqLabels    = input.bool(true, "Level Labels", group = G_LQ)
lqMax       = input.int(10, "Max Levels", minval = 2, maxval = 60, group = G_LQ)

// ── Order blocks ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
obSource    = input.string("Wick", "Block Body", options = ["Wick", "Body"], group = G_OB)
obPick      = input.string("Extreme Candle", "Origin Candle", options = ["Extreme Candle", "Last Opposite Candle"], group = G_OB)
obLookback  = input.int(20, "Origin Lookback", minval = 3, maxval = 60, group = G_OB)
obShowLast  = input.int(3, "Show Last X per side", minval = 1, maxval = 20, group = G_OB)
obExtend    = input.int(20, "Extend Right (bars)", minval = 0, maxval = 200, group = G_OB)
obTransp    = input.int(86, "Transparency", minval = 0, maxval = 95, group = G_OB)
obShowMit   = input.bool(true, "Keep Mitigated", inline = "obk", group = G_OB)
obBreaker   = input.bool(true, "Breaker Blocks", inline = "obk", group = G_OB)
obLabels    = input.bool(true, "Labels", group = G_OB)

// ── FVG ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
fvShowIFVG  = input.bool(true, "IFVG (inversion)", group = G_FV)
fvMinMult   = input.float(0.15, "Min Gap Size (× ATR)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.01, group = G_FV)
fvMerge     = input.bool(true, "Auto-merge overlaps", group = G_FV)
fvShrink    = input.bool(true, "Shrink to unfilled portion", group = G_FV)
fvRemoveFill= input.float(100.0, "Auto-remove at Fill %", minval = 1, maxval = 100, step = 5, group = G_FV)
fvExtend    = input.int(20, "Extend Right (bars)", minval = 0, maxval = 200, group = G_FV)
fvTransp    = input.int(88, "Transparency", minval = 0, maxval = 95, group = G_FV)
fvMax       = input.int(4, "Show Last X per side", minval = 1, maxval = 25, group = G_FV)

// ── Premium / discount ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
pdShowEQ    = input.bool(true, "Equilibrium", inline = "pd1", group = G_PD)
pdShowFib   = input.bool(true, "Fib 62/70.5/79", inline = "pd1", group = G_PD)
pdShowOTE   = input.bool(true, "OTE Zone", group = G_PD)
pdTransp    = input.int(95, "OTE Transparency", minval = 0, maxval = 97, group = G_PD)

// ── Previous highs / lows ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
hlPD        = input.bool(true,  "PDH / PDL", inline = "hl1", group = G_HL)
hlPW        = input.bool(true,  "PWH / PWL", inline = "hl1", group = G_HL)
hlPM        = input.bool(false, "PMH / PML", inline = "hl2", group = G_HL)
hlLabels    = input.bool(true, "Labels", inline = "hl2", group = G_HL)
